@baseUrl = https://localhost:7260

### 1. Ask - text answer
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ai/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "Explain dependency injection in .NET"
}

### 2. Ask - off-topic question (the prompt should refuse it)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ai/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "What is the best recipe for biryani?"
}

### 3. Explain - structured JSON answer
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ai/explain
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "What is async/await in C#?"
}

### 4. Tools - weather in a city
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ai/ask-with-tools
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "What's the weather in Bengaluru right now?"
}

### 5. Tools - time in a city
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ai/ask-with-tools
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "What time is it in London?"
}

### 6. RAG - see the documents
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/rag/documents

### 7. RAG step 1 - Embedding (text -> numbers)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rag/embed
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "The clinic is closed on Sunday"
}

### 8. RAG step 2 - Vector search (no exact words match, but the meaning does)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rag/search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "Which doctor should I see for my heart?"
}

### 9. RAG step 3 - Ask (search + AI answer)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rag/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "How much do I pay if I cancel my appointment late?"
}

### 10. RAG - question not in the documents (should say "I don't know")
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rag/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "Does the clinic do MRI scans?"
}
